) 3... cxd5 {Recapture with the c-pawn.} 4. d4
{And this is the Exchange Variation. [%weight 7]} 4... Nc6
{Develop with pressure on d4, exactly as in chapter 3. [%plan This is chapter 3 after 4.Nf3. Expect 5.Bd3 Nf6 and follow the Exchange chapter from there.] [%line 2.Nf3 into the Exchange]}
) ( 2. d3
{The King's Indian Attack. White is not fighting for the centre at all. [%weight 3]}
