) 3. Nd2 {The standard setup, heading for g3 and Bg2. [%weight 6]} 3... e5
{Two pawns in the centre and a free game. This is more than the Caro-Kann usually offers. [%tags dark-squares]}
( 3... dxe4!?
{Fine, but there is no reason to release the centre when Black can simply take more of it.}
) ( 3... g6!?
