{It wins the pawn, and taking on e3 first wins the pawn as well as wrecking White's kingside.}
) 11. fxe3
{Forced. Taking with the queen would drop the pawn on e5 with check to follow. [%weight 9]}
11... Qg5
{The point. The queen hits e5 and e3 at once, and White cannot hold both. [%plan Take on e5 next, then castle and play against the ruined pawns on e3 and e5. Two extra weaknesses and a pawn is more than an opening advantage.] [%line The Advance: the ...Qg5 hit]}
